  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: fix memory leak in the heif-convert JPEG writer for >8-bit images\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2024-25269.patch: fix memory leak in the heif-convert JPEG writer for >8-bit images\n     - CVE-2024-25269\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: zero-initialise image planes so uncovered grid areas do not expose heap memory\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-47247.patch: zero-initialise image planes so uncovered grid areas do not expose heap memory\n     - CVE-2026-47247\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: use size_t strides in RGB to YCbCr conversion to avoid integer overflow\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-84449.patch: use size_t strides in RGB to YCbCr conversion to avoid integer overflow\n     - CVE-2026-84449",
